sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Usuário (sk)
  participant R as Receiver
  participant M as Manager
  participant DB as SSOT (schema sum)
  participant P as Publisher
  participant REC as Reconciler
  participant OB as Observer
  participant EX as Executor
  participant Z as Zitadel
  U->>R: POST /v1/sum/services {service: ipm}
  R->>R: valida o token, a role sum.ipm.enable e a unicidade
  R->>M: requested-create (REQUESTED)
  R-->>U: 202 resourceId e operationId
  M->>DB: ligação present (Pending), Operation accepted, outbox desired
  P->>DB: lê o outbox pendente, em ordem
  P->>REC: desired (DESIRED)
  P->>OB: desired (DESIRED)
  OB->>Z: lê as autorizações do dono
  OB->>REC: observed sem roles (OBSERVED)
  OB->>M: observed sem roles (fase Reconciling, Operation in_progress)
  REC->>EX: action update (ACTION)
  EX->>EX: revalida a ação contra o desired vigente
  EX->>Z: CreateAuthorization em roles-ipm
  EX->>REC: completed (RESULT)
  EX->>OB: completed (RESULT)
  OB->>Z: lê as roles de novo
  OB->>REC: observed com as roles
  OB->>M: observed com as roles (fase Ready, Operation completed)
  U->>R: GET /v1/sum/services/{resourceId}
  R-->>U: 200 phase Ready
